
@startuml
title WCTO / Before School Check (B4SC)\nEnd-to-End Sequence Diagram

hide footbox
autonumber

skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam sequence {
  ArrowColor #20436F
  LifeLineBorderColor #6D8295
  LifeLineBackgroundColor #F4F8FB
  ParticipantBorderColor #20436F
  ParticipantBackgroundColor #EAF2F8
  ParticipantFontColor #123C58
  ActorBorderColor #20436F
  ActorFontColor #123C58
  GroupBorderColor #A8BCCB
  GroupBackgroundColor #F6F9FC
}
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #FFF8E8
skinparam NoteBorderColor #D4B66A

actor "Whānau" as Family
actor "Coordinator" as Coordinator
actor "Vision & Hearing\nProvider" as VH
actor "Nurse" as Nurse

participant "Cohorts\nService" as Cohorts
participant "Scheduler /\nOrchestrator" as Scheduler
participant "Coordinator\nApplication" as App
participant "Magic Link /\nForms Service" as Forms
participant "FHIR Platform" as FHIR
participant "Summary API" as Summary

== 1. Identify Eligible Child ==

Cohorts -> Scheduler: Eligible child identified\n(NHI, eligibility context)

Scheduler -> FHIR: GET CarePlan?subject={NHI}&category={B4SC}
FHIR --> Scheduler: Existing B4SC CarePlan or none

alt No B4SC CarePlan exists
    Scheduler -> FHIR: POST CarePlan\n(type=B4SC, status=active)
    FHIR --> Scheduler: CarePlan ID

    Scheduler -> FHIR: POST Task resources\n(Consent, Forms, V&H, Nurse Evaluation)
    FHIR --> Scheduler: Task IDs
else Existing B4SC CarePlan
    Scheduler -> FHIR: Retrieve existing Tasks
    FHIR --> Scheduler: Current workflow state
end

note over Scheduler,FHIR
One B4SC CarePlan per child.
Multiple Tasks are associated through
Task.basedOn referencing the CarePlan.

Creation and duplicate prevention
must be handled by orchestration.
end note

== 2. Provider Assignment ==

Coordinator -> App: Review eligible children
App -> FHIR: GET CarePlan / Task
FHIR --> App: Current B4SC activities

Coordinator -> App: Assign providers
App -> FHIR: PATCH Task assignment / ownership
FHIR --> App: Updated Tasks

== 3. Independent B4SC Activities ==

note over Family,Nurse
Consent, whānau forms and Vision & Hearing
may progress in any order or concurrently.

There is no consent-first workflow dependency.
Applicable consent and clinical safeguards
must still be enforced.
end note

par Consent
    Family -> Forms: Open consent form
    Forms -> FHIR: GET Questionnaire (Consent)
    FHIR --> Forms: Questionnaire definition
    Family -> Forms: Submit consent
    Forms -> FHIR: POST QuestionnaireResponse
    FHIR --> Forms: QuestionnaireResponse ID
    Forms -> Scheduler: Consent submission event
    Scheduler -> FHIR: Update consent Task\n(subject to review rules)

else Whānau Forms
    Family -> Forms: Open Health History,\nPEDS-R and SDQ Parent
    Forms -> FHIR: GET Questionnaire definitions
    FHIR --> Forms: Form definitions
    Family -> Forms: Submit responses
    Forms -> FHIR: POST QuestionnaireResponse(s)
    FHIR --> Forms: Response IDs
    Forms -> Scheduler: Form submission event
    Scheduler -> FHIR: Update relevant Task progress

else Vision and Hearing
    VH -> App: Open assigned screening activity
    App -> FHIR: GET screening Task / Questionnaire
    FHIR --> App: Screening details
    VH -> App: Record screening outcomes
    App -> FHIR: POST QuestionnaireResponse\nand approved clinical results
    FHIR --> App: Saved resources
    App -> Scheduler: Screening completion event
    Scheduler -> FHIR: Update V&H Task
end

== 4. Nurse Review and Evaluation ==

Nurse -> App: Open child B4SC record
App -> FHIR: GET CarePlan, Tasks,\nQuestionnaireResponses and results
FHIR --> App: Current clinical information

Nurse -> App: Review consent, whānau forms,\nand screening results

opt Additional information or corrections needed
    Nurse -> App: Record review / amendment
    App -> FHIR: Save approved updates\nand Provenance where applicable
    FHIR --> App: Updated resources
end

Nurse -> Forms: Complete Nurse Evaluation
Forms -> FHIR: POST QuestionnaireResponse\n(Nurse Evaluation)
FHIR --> Forms: Nurse Evaluation response

Forms -> Scheduler: Nurse evaluation submitted
Scheduler -> FHIR: Retrieve required activity statuses
FHIR --> Scheduler: Task and review state

alt Required reviews complete and nurse signs off
    Scheduler -> FHIR: Update Nurse Evaluation Task\nstatus=completed
    Scheduler -> FHIR: Update CarePlan workflow state\nper agreed completion rules
    FHIR --> Scheduler: Updated resources
else Completion requirements not met
    Scheduler -> FHIR: Retain outstanding Task states
    FHIR --> Scheduler: B4SC remains incomplete
end

== 5. Clinical and Whānau Summaries ==

opt B4SC clinically completed
    Scheduler -> Summary: Generate B4SC summaries\n(CarePlan / child reference)
    Summary -> FHIR: Retrieve approved clinical information
    FHIR --> Summary: B4SC results and assessments
    Summary -> FHIR: Store summary output\n(DocumentReference or agreed model)
    FHIR --> Summary: Summary references
    Summary --> App: Clinical and whānau summaries available
end

== 6. Referrals and Follow-up ==

opt Follow-up or referral required
    Nurse -> App: Record referral / follow-up
    App -> FHIR: Create follow-up Task\n(and ServiceRequest if adopted)
    FHIR --> App: Follow-up references

    App -> Scheduler: Follow-up created
    Scheduler -> FHIR: Track referral / follow-up status

    note over Scheduler,FHIR
    Referral follow-up can remain open
    after clinical B4SC completion.

    CarePlan closure depends on the
    agreed referral outcome rules.
    end note
end

== 7. Workflow Status ==

Coordinator -> App: View B4SC status
App -> FHIR: GET CarePlan and associated Tasks
FHIR --> App: Current progress, completion,\nand outstanding follow-up
App --> Coordinator: Display B4SC status

@enduml
